type particles
version 1
---
# Shards thrown out of a crater every second: lit tetrahedra that tumble,
# bounce on the ground and kick a puff of dust at each bounce. The tick
# simulates them (the events line), so gameplay reads every bounce.
maxParticles 160
shape point
spread 35
rate 0
burst 0 40
duration 1
lifetime 1.6 2
speed 3.5 5
size 0.12 0.22
color 0.55 0.42 0.32
rotation 0 360
angularVelocity -540 540
gravity 0 -9.8 0
collision 0.35 0.4
render mesh tetrahedron
lit true
events birth death collision
subEmitter collision "fx/dust.ogt" 2 0.1
